{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:fc8065a3eef0b22c","name":"Staggering Attack","source":{"id":"source:reference-fc8065a3eef0b22c","title":"Staggering Attack","revision":19785,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:35:59Z","sha256":"f87642e517ddb5fe07c4708bf332536d5fa2655144be20068aaada8958c18ecc","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19785","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Staggering%20Attack&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-fc8065a3eef0b22c","blocks":[{"tag":"h4","children":["Scum and Villainy"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can deliver nasty attacks that leave your opponents gasping.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Sneak Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sneak_Attack"}]}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rapid Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rapid_Shot","referenceId":"reference:d5cac053fa8ba463"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rapid Strike"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rapid_Strike","referenceId":"reference:700a0453398913da"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," Any time you would deal additional damage from a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feat"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," that grants one or more extra dice of damage, you can forgo the extra damage to move the target 2 squares per extra die sacrificed. This movement does not provoke ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Galaxy at War"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can deliver punishing blows to your enemies, distracting them and keeping them from focusing their efforts.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Base Attack Bonus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus"}," +1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," When using a melee weapon with which you are proficient, you can make an attack that disrupts an enemy's concentration. You take a -2 penalty on your attack roll, and if your attack deals damage, the target takes a -2 penalty to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"}," until the end of your next turn. Alternatively, you can take a -5 penalty to your attack roll, and if your attack deals damage, the target takes a -5 penalty to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"}," until the end of your next turn.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
